  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Community Engagement and Resilience Programme (KCERP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the EU&#xbf;s action is to reduce the number and intensity of incidents of violent extremism and cybersecurity attacks in Kenya. The objective of this call for proposals is to strengthen the resilience of communities and women and men in all their diversity `at risk&#xbf; of suffering from (or being engaged in) violent extremism (VE).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
